  (descr "noknok mezzanine spring pins, interface rev 2 (22 Sep 2026), cluster D (6 x BAT WIRELESS BWCD-L5.5W2.0H3.0 SMD pogo pins, LCSC C2826550: body D2.0 x 4.0 mm, plunger D1.5, free length 5.5 mm, stroke 1.5 mm, 70 gf, 1.5 A, 30 V, 30 mOhm, 10k cycles; pad D2.6 with paste): USB port on pads: USB_DP, USB_DM, GND / MEZZ_5V, MEZZ_PRESENT, MEZZ_FAULT (PRESENT low = I take the USB uplink). INCLUDES the M2.5 mounting hole (2.5 mm NPTH, noknok standard) at its origin - the mezzanine hole that meets the hub's H4: place on the mezzanine TOP at that hole position, rotation 0. Mates with noknok_Mezzanine_D_Pads_M2.5. Board-to-board 4.5 mm (1.0 mm compression) on M2.5 x 4.5 standoffs; mate the boards straight, guided by the standoffs.")
